<mxCell id="p0-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Order publishes a lifecycle event. Notification picks a template, writes one message row per channel, and Acks. Senders run after the commit, read the contact from Identity, and call the provider.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
