<mxCell id="p2-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Campaign publishes notification.requested{broadcast} with an S3 audience file. Notification saves a job and Acks. The broadcast worker pages through the audience, respects quiet hours, and writes message rows.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
