<mxCell id="p3-v35" parent="p3-v34" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Providers never call Notification directly; receipts enter at webhook-adapter (D-03).&lt;br&gt;• Reachability stops the next send to a bounced email or a blocked LINE user.&lt;br&gt;• FCM has no receipt. An invalid token marks the device during the send (LLD 15). LINE unfollow sets line_blocked; a later follow clears it." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
