<mxCell id="p4-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="After login, and whenever FCM gives a new token, the app calls RegisterDevice through customer-bff. Notification stores the token against the customer so pushes in LLD 1 can reach the phone.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
