<mxCell id="lld-5-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Payment publishes the lifecycle. Notification messages the shopper only on refunded. Order already turns a payment failure into order.events, so those variants Ack with no row.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
