<mxCell id="lld-5-n23" parent="lld-5-n22" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="topic payment.events&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key brand_id:transaction_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;oneof authorized · captured · failed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;voided · refunded&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;paid_out · payout_failed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;rule (draft)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;refunded → template refund&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;channels push + inbox&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;carries customer_id, never a phone" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n24" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n25" parent="lld-5-n24" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="processed_event  event_id PK&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;only when the variant is refunded&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;messages&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UNIQUE(event_id, customer_id, channel)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status queued&lt;br&gt;priority = transactional" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n26" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n27" parent="lld-5-n26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Fact, so dedupe on event_id. A replay of refunded hits the unique message row.&lt;br&gt;• Every other variant Acks with no processed_event row and no message.&lt;br&gt;• Ack after the rows commit. The send itself is LLD 15." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-5-n29" parent="lld-5-n28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Order turns payment_failed into order.events{cancelled}. A second message here would double-send.&lt;br&gt;• A wallet top-up is payment.events{captured}. Wallet uses notification.requested{send} if the shopper should hear about it (LLD 7).&lt;br&gt;• No fact out. CSC reads the row on LLD 12." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
