<mxCell id="lld-6-n28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-6-n29" parent="lld-6-n28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Command, so dedupe on event_id.&lt;br&gt;• The contact is read at send time (LLD 15), so a replay cannot stamp a phone onto the row.&lt;br&gt;• A var that looks like a phone or an email fails the command. Nothing is stored." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-6-n30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-6-n31" parent="lld-6-n30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A domain that already publishes a fact does not also send. Order and Payment are not producers.&lt;br&gt;• When Loyalty has a second consumer, it publishes a fact and stops sending this command.&lt;br&gt;• Senders are LLD 15. Marketing uses the marketing pool and waits for quiet hours." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
