<mxCell id="lld-7-n30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-7-n31" parent="lld-7-n30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• MarkRead is idempotent. A second call keeps the first read_at.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline from customer-bff. The app retries UNAVAILABLE.&lt;br&gt;• Page size caps at 50." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-7-n32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-7-n33" parent="lld-7-n32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• The body is the rendered template. It is not the phone or the email.&lt;br&gt;• The badge on the socket is the same unread count (LLD 14). A dropped frame is fixed by listing again.&lt;br&gt;• Another brand's rows are invisible. brand_id comes from the header, not the request body." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
