<mxCell id="lld-8-n25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-8-n26" parent="lld-8-n25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Last write wins. The same flags sent twice are a no-op.&lt;br&gt;• A missing row means marketing is on. The customer has not chosen yet.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline from customer-bff." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-8-n27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-8-n28" parent="lld-8-n27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A marketing send needs this flag and Identity consent. Either one off skips the channel (LLD 15).&lt;br&gt;• An order update ignores these flags. Quiet hours do not apply to it either.&lt;br&gt;• This is not PDPA consent. Identity owns consent. Turning marketing off here does not change consent." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="10 · Templates" id="lld-9"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
