<mxCell id="lld-9-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="admin-bff is the only write door. The engine trusts X-Roles and rejects the call when manage-notification is absent. A new version does not rewrite a message already queued.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
