<mxCell id="lld-9-n22" parent="lld-9-n21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc UpsertTemplate(UpsertTemplateRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (Template);&lt;br&gt;rpc ListTemplates(ListTemplatesRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (ListTemplatesResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message UpsertTemplateRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string template_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string channel = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string locale = 3;   // th | en&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string subject = 4;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string body = 5;     // {{name}} placeholders&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string priority = 6; // otp|transactional|marketing&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;metadata: x-brand-id · x-roles · idempotency-key" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n24" parent="lld-9-n23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="templates&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;brand_id · template_id · channel · locale&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;version · subject · body · priority&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;created_by&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UNIQUE(... , version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;audit  actor · template_id · version" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n26" parent="lld-9-n25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Same idempotency-key returns the first version. It does not write another.&lt;br&gt;• The message row stores template_id and version taken at commit. A later edit does not change it.&lt;br&gt;• ListTemplates is a read. It returns every version, newest first." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-9-n28" parent="lld-9-n27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• The engine does not call admin to re-check the grant. Kong and admin-bff already did. A missing role is PERMISSION_DENIED.&lt;br&gt;• A template is usable when both th and en exist for that channel.&lt;br&gt;• Rendering happens at send time from the stored version, with vars from the command or the order fact." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="11 · Brand channel config" id="lld-10"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
