<mxCell id="lld-10-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="admin-bff writes the per-brand setup: SMS sender ID, SES identity, LINE OA, FCM project. The FCM service account, the APNs key, and the LINE token go to Vault. The row stores the path, never the secret.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
