<mxCell id="lld-12-n24" parent="lld-12-n23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="no write&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;read broadcast_jobs&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · cursor&lt;br&gt;read messages&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;count grouped by status&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;where campaign_id = ?" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-12-n25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-12-n26" parent="lld-12-n25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A read. Counts move as senders and receipts commit.&lt;br&gt;• delivered waits for a receipt (LLD 4). sent is the provider 200.&lt;br&gt;• skipped is consent, preference, or reachability (LLD 15)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-12-n27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-12-n28" parent="lld-12-n27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• No customer list on this RPC. CSC uses ListMessages (LLD 12).&lt;br&gt;• There is no notification fact topic. This read is the whole stats path.&lt;br&gt;• A campaign in another brand is NOT_FOUND." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="14 · WebSocket fanout" id="lld-13"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="lld-13-n1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Notification LLD 14 — WebSocket: customer-bff fans out, and a dropped frame is gone" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-13-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="The sender publishes on ws:brand_id:customer_id. customer-bff, which holds the socket, subscribes and writes to the connections on that pod. The app re-reads on reconnect. Push and the inbox row carry the same update.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
