<mxCell id="lld-14-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="After the message row commits, a pool worker takes a token, reads the contact, and sends. Inbox writes a row. The WebSocket frame does not fail the message. Marketing waits for quiet hours. Transactional does not.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
