<mxCell id="lld-15-n22" parent="lld-15-n21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc UnregisterDevice(UnregisterDeviceRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (Empty);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message UnregisterDeviceRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string fcm_token = 1;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;metadata: x-brand-id · x-principal-id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the row stays, with invalid_at set&lt;br&gt;LLD 5 upsert clears invalid_at" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n24" parent="lld-15-n23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="devices&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;invalid_at = now&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;where brand_id + fcm_token&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and customer_id = principal&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;reachability push left as it is" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n26" parent="lld-15-n25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Calling it twice is OK. The second call finds invalid_at already set and returns OK.&lt;br&gt;• An unknown token returns OK so logout does not fail the app.&lt;br&gt;• A token that RegisterDevice moved to another customer returns NOT_FOUND." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lld-15-n28" parent="lld-15-n27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• The trigger is still a draft with the app team: logout, or also an OS token revoke.&lt;br&gt;• The engine behavior if the RPC is called is this page.&lt;br&gt;• LLD 15 skips a device with invalid_at set. One bad token does not fail the other devices." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
